  "text": "The stop you moved usually wasn’t broken.\n\nIt was the line you agreed to before the trade got emotional.\n\nDani’s rule is simple: define invalidation before entry, then respect it when the candle gets close.\n\nThat one habit can protect your capital, your process, and your next decision.\n\nEducational content only. Not financial advice.\n\n#TheBetterTraders #TradingEducation #RiskManagement #CryptoTrading",
